  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Biogas in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An autonomously growing market for bio-digesters in Kenya which leads to increased utilization of bio-digesters resulting in reduction of greenhouse gas emissions and increases socio-economic developments through improved access to energy, improved health, fuel savings, time savings, improved soil quality, increased yields, savings on chemical fertilizer and pesticides, improved waste management and increased employment.</narrative>
  </description>
